WEBVTT

00:01.390 --> 00:05.400
Ur, the royal capital of Limia, and Ruinas, 
the imperial capital of Gritonia.

00:05.750 --> 00:09.570
The demons have launched simultaneous 
attacks against these two places.

00:09.980 --> 00:12.520
So the disturbance in 
this city was a decoy.

00:12.980 --> 00:16.280
Damn those demons. 
How dare they execute such a scheme?

00:17.050 --> 00:21.140
It's possible they used magic 
to transform their appearance.

00:21.140 --> 00:23.120
You mean they disguised 
themselves as hyumans?

00:23.560 --> 00:29.060
Perhaps that's how they gradually moved 
their forces without our knowledge.

00:29.720 --> 00:34.320
<i>I heard Sairitsu-san's 
disguised demon guards</i>

00:34.320 --> 00:38.020
<i>returned to their nation 
during the tournament.</i>

00:38.370 --> 00:44.220
<i>Which means it's likely demons have 
infiltrated the heart of Laurel.</i>

00:44.730 --> 00:47.530
What's going on with Aion's forces?

00:47.530 --> 00:50.480
They've been stopped in the neighboring 
cities and are unable to move.

00:51.940 --> 00:55.980
In any case, we can't do anything 
unless we return to our countries.

00:56.730 --> 01:00.240
Kuzunoha, I'd like you to 
teleport me and Princess Lily.

01:00.680 --> 01:02.450
On that subject,

01:02.820 --> 01:07.210
because we made heavy use of the sword during 
the disturbance, it's approaching its limit.

01:07.210 --> 01:09.700
D-Don't say that.

01:09.700 --> 01:12.400
The fate of the kingdom is at stake!

01:12.400 --> 01:14.060
I understand, but...

01:14.510 --> 01:16.630
What are we to do?

01:16.630 --> 01:20.320
Kuzunoha-sama, please convince 
Tomoe-sama to help us.

01:20.320 --> 01:22.130
I swear I'll return this favor.

01:22.130 --> 01:24.340
I'll grant you whatever 
reward you desire.

01:24.340 --> 01:27.550
But if you refuse to help us...

01:28.200 --> 01:30.030
<i>He's practically threatening me.</i>

01:30.330 --> 01:32.930
<i>Young Master, it's time.</i>

01:32.930 --> 01:33.980
<i>Yeah.</i>

01:35.050 --> 01:38.890
<i>Very well. Given that it's an 
emergency, it can't be helped.</i>

01:39.610 --> 01:41.440
I'm glad to hear you say that!

01:41.790 --> 01:44.420
A-Are you sure about this?

01:44.420 --> 01:48.390
We could lose this sword that has supported 
the Kuzunoha Trading Company.

01:48.870 --> 01:54.590
<i>Tomoe, the kingdom and empire 
that fight on the front lines</i>

01:54.590 --> 01:57.370
<i>every day to protect us are in danger!</i>

01:58.380 --> 01:59.930
Very well.

02:00.380 --> 02:02.040
Thank you!

02:02.040 --> 02:03.840
We are indebted to you, Kuzunoha.

02:04.400 --> 02:08.480
Joshua, stay here and support 
the neighboring cities.

02:08.480 --> 02:09.340
Yes, Your Majesty.

02:17.840 --> 02:19.700
<i>Don't you think you're overdoing it?</i>

02:19.700 --> 02:21.850
<i>It's fake anyway.</i>

02:23.460 --> 02:26.370
<i>They completely bought it.</i>

02:25.580 --> 02:32.250
<b>Heh heh heh...</b>

02:26.370 --> 02:31.910
<i>The demons outsmarted them because 
they're so naïve. Such fools.</i>

02:33.040 --> 02:35.600
Please leave me alone for a while.

02:36.050 --> 02:38.760
I must calm my mind.

02:42.490 --> 02:44.300
<i>Her mind, huh?</i>

02:44.300 --> 02:47.390
<i>She must be returning to the demiplane.</i>

03:05.160 --> 03:07.040
<b>Season Two</b>

04:18.110 --> 04:22.030
<b>Night Twenty    The Utterly Hateable Good-For-Nothing</b>

04:18.110 --> 04:22.030
<b>Night Twenty    The Utterly Hateable Good-For-Nothing</b>

04:21.250 --> 04:23.900
Young Master, regarding this invasion...

04:24.190 --> 04:27.990
If the hyumans still underestimate 
the demons' strength,

04:27.990 --> 04:30.700
they will suffer great losses.

04:31.350 --> 04:32.710
You mean...

04:33.430 --> 04:38.250
They believe the disturbance that took 
place in this city was a decoy.

04:38.250 --> 04:40.680
They don't understand the situation.

04:41.400 --> 04:46.420
Rona probably intends for the 
Gritonia Empire to be the true decoy.

04:46.740 --> 04:48.890
Then the demons' true target is...

04:49.390 --> 04:52.110
Yes. The Kingdom of Limia.

04:52.700 --> 04:55.180
<i>He's smiling. How terrifying.</i>

04:55.460 --> 04:57.850
But why Limia?

04:57.850 --> 05:02.240
They must intend to slay the kingdom's 
greatest treasure: their hero.

05:02.240 --> 05:04.400
Not Gritonia's hero?

05:04.400 --> 05:07.190
No. There is much I don't know, but...

05:07.730 --> 05:11.990
The empire's hero uses his Charm 
to turn his targets into puppets,

05:11.990 --> 05:15.270
robbing them of their sanity and 
forcing them to obey his will.

05:15.270 --> 05:19.580
Meanwhile, I've heard the kingdom's hero's 
charm comes from her innate charisma,

05:19.580 --> 05:23.160
and she produces strong-willed 
and fanatical believers.

05:23.900 --> 05:28.270
If that's the case, then Limia's hero 
will be the greater threat in the future.

05:28.810 --> 05:30.840
Because she doesn't 
rely on a special power,

05:30.840 --> 05:34.080
the fervor she generates could 
produce massive waves.

05:34.780 --> 05:36.250
I see.

05:36.820 --> 05:42.770
Personally, I owe nothing to the heroes, 
but I'd still like to help them if I can.

05:42.770 --> 05:45.390
After all, we were summoned 
from the same world.

05:45.400 --> 05:51.990
<b>Waaah</b>

05:45.870 --> 05:50.850
That said, thanks to the act we just 
put on, we can't teleport anymore.

05:50.850 --> 05:51.990
What should we do?

05:51.990 --> 05:56.080
In that case, why not secretly 
send denizens of the demiplane?

05:56.490 --> 05:57.950
We can't do that.

05:57.950 --> 06:01.980
We can't ask them to fight 
when we're not going.

06:01.980 --> 06:05.420
I see. I thought it was a good idea.

06:05.860 --> 06:07.430
This is a problem.

06:07.430 --> 06:12.130
I don't want to forsake the heroes, 
but I also can't openly help them.

06:13.760 --> 06:16.720
Telepathy has been restored now of all times?

06:17.050 --> 06:19.850
He doesn't realize it, 
but it's a miraculous move.

06:20.740 --> 06:25.090
Makoto-kun has unexpectedly demonstrated 
the Kuzunoha Trading Company's strength

06:25.090 --> 06:29.340
to the great nations and earned the trust 
and affection of this city's people.

06:29.940 --> 06:35.080
But this is Makoto-kun we're talking about. 
He's generally not lucky.

06:35.600 --> 06:39.200
He must've been born under a star that 
destined him to get caught up in trouble.

06:41.600 --> 06:42.740
Impossible.

06:43.200 --> 06:44.960
She shouldn't be able to act right now.

06:44.960 --> 06:46.060
Huh?

06:48.020 --> 06:50.030
Young Master, this is...

06:50.030 --> 06:51.330
We're being forcibly teleported?

06:51.330 --> 06:55.500
Damn that shitty goddess! 
Who else could it be?

06:56.850 --> 06:59.170
I-It's incredibly powerful.

06:59.690 --> 07:02.190
Give up already, shitty goddess!

07:02.450 --> 07:06.690
Young Master, anyone who sees this light 
will realize it's the goddess's power.

07:07.020 --> 07:09.930
If they see us resisting it...

07:09.930 --> 07:12.230
Yeah, that would be bad.

07:14.030 --> 07:18.030
That would ruin everything we've 
done over the past few days.

07:18.500 --> 07:23.110
Being declared an enemy of the goddess by 
the church would be far too disadvantageous.

07:23.110 --> 07:26.670
Damn it! Things were going so well!

07:27.280 --> 07:30.590
Damn it!

07:39.670 --> 07:41.380
<i>If I ever came back here,</i>

07:41.380 --> 07:45.490
<i>I thought it would be when I'd built 
up the confidence to smack her.</i>

07:47.430 --> 07:48.950
Y-Young Master?

07:49.910 --> 07:52.770
I guess you could say I'm over it.

07:52.770 --> 07:59.950
Besides, I might get a chance to smack 
that... King? Queen of selfishness.

08:05.160 --> 08:09.580
You underestimate me, Misumi.

08:11.120 --> 08:14.780
Well, well, goddess. It's been a while.

08:15.310 --> 08:17.980
You never cease to disgust me.

08:17.980 --> 08:21.690
I thought I ordered you to stay 
quietly at the edge of the world.

08:22.060 --> 08:24.510
Unfortunately, Tsukuyomi-sama has granted me

08:24.510 --> 08:27.700
permission to act as I please in this world.

08:27.980 --> 08:31.090
When I finally decided to help out in the war,

08:31.090 --> 08:33.660
I was rewarded with unbelievably 
reckless behavior.

08:33.660 --> 08:36.460
It took a lot of work to track you down.

08:36.810 --> 08:41.840
Now, Misumi. The demons' surprise 
attack has left things in a poor state.

08:42.320 --> 08:45.840
I'm sending you to Limia. 
You will help the hero there.

08:45.840 --> 08:47.220
Why?

08:47.220 --> 08:51.630
Rather than relying on me, 
surely you could do it yourself.

08:51.630 --> 08:54.330
You think I can casually 
descend upon the world?

08:54.630 --> 08:57.260
Gods have their own circumstances.

08:57.260 --> 08:59.920
In any case, "yes" is the 
only acceptable response.

08:59.920 --> 09:02.810
<i>She's so infuriating.</i>

09:03.530 --> 09:07.770
Even if I go to Limia, 
I might side with the demons.

09:07.770 --> 09:12.410
Have you lost your mind? 
You have no reason to help the demons.

09:13.780 --> 09:17.800
Sure I do. I hate you.

09:17.800 --> 09:21.360
I think I might get along with 
the demons. What do you think?

09:21.360 --> 09:25.300
You're a fool. You're throwing 
a tantrum like a child.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.900
In this world, I am the rules.

09:27.900 --> 09:31.860
If you refuse to follow them, 
I could erase you here and now.

09:31.860 --> 09:33.600
That's hardly a threat.

09:33.600 --> 09:35.720
If you could, you would've killed me

09:35.720 --> 09:38.960
when you teleported me in my 
fight against the Dragonslayer.

09:40.610 --> 09:42.750
Your rules aren't absolute.

09:43.050 --> 09:44.420
A goddess? Yeah, right.

09:44.420 --> 09:49.400
You're a failure who can't even make 
this twisted world fit your vision.

09:52.940 --> 09:59.520
I see. It seems simply bringing you 
here was more than you deserved.

10:02.200 --> 10:04.670
Goddess!

10:05.060 --> 10:06.870
There's someone here to see you.

10:06.870 --> 10:08.340
What? Again?

10:08.730 --> 10:12.380
Can't they take a hint? 
I don't want to see them.

10:12.880 --> 10:16.560
But they're from the original world...

10:18.800 --> 10:21.210
That meathead came in here?

10:23.060 --> 10:24.470
Misumi.

10:24.470 --> 10:25.560
What?

10:25.850 --> 10:31.890
I understand that you're not happy 
with me, so let this be the last time.

10:31.890 --> 10:33.270
Excuse me?

10:33.270 --> 10:37.250
In the future, as long as you don't 
aggressively oppose hyumans,

10:37.250 --> 10:39.430
I won't interfere with you.

10:39.430 --> 10:41.230
How does that sound?

10:41.630 --> 10:43.580
That's not enough.

10:43.580 --> 10:47.010
You're sending me to help the hero 
to satisfy your own selfish demand.

10:47.320 --> 10:51.030
You insist on a reward? How greedy.

10:51.030 --> 10:54.470
So are you.

10:56.150 --> 10:59.820
Fine. I don't have time for any of this.

10:59.820 --> 11:02.710
Tell me what you want. Right this instant.

11:02.710 --> 11:03.270
Huh?

11:03.270 --> 11:08.300
<i>Now? But I only said that to annoy her. 
I can't think of anything.</i>

11:08.750 --> 11:10.640
You're out of time.

11:11.330 --> 11:14.630
You're like a child to demand 
something without even

11:14.630 --> 11:16.780
being able to decide what you want.

11:17.120 --> 11:18.110
Begone.

11:18.470 --> 11:22.590
Th-Then grant him the blessing 
of speaking Common.

11:22.590 --> 11:23.320
Shiki...

11:23.700 --> 11:25.960
<i>I see. Language, huh?</i>

11:25.960 --> 11:28.910
<i>I'm so used to writing, 
it didn't even occur to me.</i>

11:29.230 --> 11:32.870
I don't remember allowing 
you to speak, you nobody.

11:32.870 --> 11:34.330
Nobody?!

11:34.600 --> 11:35.720
But...

11:36.600 --> 11:39.900
Son of Misumi, you can't speak Common?

11:39.900 --> 11:42.470
No, because of your curse.

11:42.470 --> 11:46.990
I simply granted you the ability to speak 
everything other than the hyuman language.

11:46.990 --> 11:51.350
If you still can't speak it, then you're even 
less competent than the demihumans.

11:51.350 --> 11:55.740
Do you have time to argue, shitty goddess?

11:56.100 --> 12:00.820
Don't call me shitty, you good-for-nothing. 
You're unbelievably infuriating.

12:01.620 --> 12:05.390
But very well. If that's all you 
want, then you can have it now.

12:12.480 --> 12:13.620
Young Master!

12:13.620 --> 12:16.500
Oh, it's not working? How odd.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.200
Does that hurt?

12:19.200 --> 12:22.090
But you're the ones who asked for it.

12:29.180 --> 12:30.400
Young Master...

12:30.800 --> 12:32.020
And now it's over.

12:32.740 --> 12:35.790
Now go eliminate the threat 
against the hero.

12:35.790 --> 12:39.330
While you're at it, take Fort Stella.

12:39.330 --> 12:41.320
If you can't, then I'll kill—

12:41.320 --> 12:44.020
no, I'll grant you death.

12:44.570 --> 12:49.450
P-Protect the hero and take Fort Stella?

12:49.450 --> 12:51.360
You're sure that's what you want?

12:51.780 --> 12:58.250
Yes. You know what will happen to you 
if you break a promise to a god.

12:59.200 --> 13:00.130
Young Master!

13:03.550 --> 13:05.050
What is this?!

13:05.410 --> 13:08.880
Probably a direct flight to 
the royal capital of Limia.

13:08.880 --> 13:11.860
How are you so calm?

13:11.860 --> 13:13.590
This is my third time.

13:13.980 --> 13:17.150
It's no more than a thrill ride to me now.

13:17.150 --> 13:21.290
Anyway... I'll control our landing.

13:21.290 --> 13:24.810
Could you cover us in darkness 
so we can conceal ourselves?

13:24.810 --> 13:26.460
V-Very well.

13:28.350 --> 13:31.790
<i>She seemed awfully flustered, though.</i>

13:31.790 --> 13:35.880
<i>If she's busy right now, 
this could be our chance to act.</i>

13:37.940 --> 13:39.950
<i>Tomoe, Mio. Can you hear me?</i>

13:39.950 --> 13:41.890
<i>Young Master. You're all right.</i>

13:41.890 --> 13:45.410
<i>It was the goddess again, wasn't it? 
What did she do to you?</i>

13:45.410 --> 13:49.250
<i>I'm fine. I'm in the skies over Limia right now.</i>

13:49.250 --> 13:50.970
<i>I have a request for you two.</i>

13:52.100 --> 13:55.250
<i>It sounds important.</i>

13:55.250 --> 13:57.770
<i>Yeah. Tomoe and Mio,</i>

13:57.770 --> 14:03.300
<i>I want you to lead adequately-trained 
highland orcs, mist lizards,</i>

14:04.050 --> 14:07.410
<i>and any other volunteers...</i>

14:07.890 --> 14:09.530
<i>and take Kaleneon.</i>

14:11.630 --> 14:14.220
<i>Have Eva-san and Luria-san act, too.</i>

14:14.220 --> 14:18.200
<i>Also, I'd appreciate it if you installed 
a replacement for me at the academy.</i>

14:18.940 --> 14:21.180
<i>I'm counting on you two.</i>

14:21.500 --> 14:22.280
<i>Bye for now.</i>

14:25.360 --> 14:27.330
Mio, doesn't that excite you?

14:27.330 --> 14:29.920
Yes. I'm trembling with excitement.

14:30.710 --> 14:33.630
Now the demiplane will 
experience all four seasons.

14:33.630 --> 14:37.260
Yes, but that hardly matters right now.

14:37.260 --> 14:42.770
This is the first time the young master 
has ordered us to fight for him.

14:43.170 --> 14:49.370
I never knew it would feel this good 
to have him say he's counting on us.

14:49.370 --> 14:52.950
We must share this joy with the others.

14:52.950 --> 14:56.130
Like us, they are his people.

15:00.050 --> 15:03.500
Everyone, we are at war with the demons.

15:03.860 --> 15:07.580
This will be the demiplane 
denizens' first battle.

15:07.580 --> 15:09.250
Highland orcs.

15:09.250 --> 15:10.930
Mist lizards.

15:10.930 --> 15:13.680
You've been chosen personally 
by the young master.

15:13.680 --> 15:19.310
The time has come for you to demonstrate the 
strength you've developed in the demiplane.

15:19.310 --> 15:22.610
Show no restraint. 
Fight to your heart's content.

15:22.610 --> 15:25.360
The days you've spent 
training in the demiplane,

15:25.360 --> 15:28.260
and the young master who 
recognizes your efforts...

15:28.260 --> 15:30.830
You must not betray either.

15:31.090 --> 15:33.040
Now fight with all your strength!

15:33.920 --> 15:37.110
This is our first battle in 
the young master's name!

15:37.110 --> 15:43.510
Crush anyone who defies us 
thoroughly and with dignity!

15:52.260 --> 15:56.820
This is no time to complain that
I'm no good at detection spells.

15:57.140 --> 16:00.640
<b></b>Demon Territory Kaleneon

15:57.420 --> 15:59.750
Such meticulous work.

15:59.750 --> 16:06.750
I can tell exactly how many enemies are in 
their base and where they're concentrated.

16:09.870 --> 16:14.130
I can't wait any longer. Excuse me.

16:16.270 --> 16:18.770
Mio is heading inside the fort.

16:18.770 --> 16:21.690
Then I'll secure the demiplane gate.

16:22.110 --> 16:26.550
I'm not sure I'll be 
able to hold back tonight.

16:26.890 --> 16:28.920
Keep your distance for a while.

16:33.760 --> 16:36.850
Is everyone ready?

16:37.980 --> 16:41.760
There are roughly 2,000 demons 
stationed on this land.

16:42.210 --> 16:45.010
In contrast, there are only 100 of us.

16:45.500 --> 16:48.620
Once Tomoe-sama teleports us inside the fort,

16:48.620 --> 16:51.270
we won't need to penetrate 
the castle gates.

16:51.900 --> 16:56.000
However, that's hardly a fun way to fight.

16:56.510 --> 17:00.700
We must deliver a complete and total 
victory to the young master.

17:01.400 --> 17:05.940
I believe that everyone here 
on this day is capable of that.

17:06.590 --> 17:08.910
Let's go.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.190
Hey, wake up.

17:12.190 --> 17:12.770
Huh?

17:12.770 --> 17:14.180
I'm here to relieve you.

17:14.180 --> 17:15.930
Finally.

17:19.450 --> 17:20.840
Is that...

17:20.840 --> 17:22.640
W-We're under attack!

17:22.640 --> 17:24.040
We're being attacked?

17:24.040 --> 17:25.190
Archers, hurry!

17:25.190 --> 17:28.030
Don't they know demons control this fort?

17:28.330 --> 17:30.740
Don't let them get close! Fire, fire!

17:33.320 --> 17:35.040
Asial Deen!

17:39.260 --> 17:41.790
A magic barrier? It's enormous!

17:41.790 --> 17:43.030
Agares!

17:43.030 --> 17:44.000
Got it!

17:44.000 --> 17:45.970
Baldie Ouran!

17:47.080 --> 17:48.430
A defensive barrier!

17:48.430 --> 17:49.910
Get that orc!

17:54.120 --> 17:57.180
Don't underestimate the demiplane's orcs!

17:57.720 --> 17:59.340
Defend the gates!

17:59.340 --> 18:00.600
Don't let them through!

18:09.730 --> 18:11.160
Demihuman forces?

18:11.160 --> 18:12.400
Stop them!

18:12.400 --> 18:14.100
Rout them!

18:21.530 --> 18:23.330
Son of a bitch!

18:23.880 --> 18:24.990
"Son"?

18:31.570 --> 18:34.260
Do not underestimate us 
because of our numbers.

18:34.260 --> 18:36.040
Fight at full strength.

18:36.040 --> 18:40.510
If you are weak, we cannot fight 
at full strength, either.

18:40.510 --> 18:41.870
No, don't!

18:43.760 --> 18:46.300
Welcome to the mirage town.

18:46.300 --> 18:50.460
This town was built by and 
belongs to the young master.

18:50.460 --> 18:54.680
Do you know why you were brought here?

18:56.020 --> 19:03.770
B-Because Kuzunoha-sama is going to 
retake our homeland of Kaleneon.

19:04.190 --> 19:09.610
In exchange, we swore to offer him 
everything the Aensland family has.

19:12.310 --> 19:13.450
Listen closely.

19:14.020 --> 19:17.490
You are the saviors and heroes who continued

19:17.490 --> 19:21.540
to resist the demons in Kaleneon 
and finally drove them off.

19:21.540 --> 19:22.610
Huh?

19:22.610 --> 19:25.050
Kaleneon hasn't been destroyed.

19:25.050 --> 19:27.680
Since all other noble families 
have been eliminated,

19:27.680 --> 19:30.960
the Aenslands gained the 
Kuzunoha Trading Company

19:30.960 --> 19:34.930
as an ally and miraculously won 
back Kaleneon from the demons.

19:34.930 --> 19:38.790
We believe that's the story 
the young master is writing,

19:39.250 --> 19:44.490
so you need to develop the 
skills to revive a nation.

19:44.490 --> 19:46.490
Revive a nation?

19:46.490 --> 19:48.210
B-But how?

19:48.550 --> 19:54.120
You will learn the engineering and farming 
skills necessary to develop a community.

19:54.430 --> 19:58.100
We'd like you to learn those skills here 
and spread them throughout Kaleneon.

19:58.100 --> 20:01.500
Naturally, we'll send 
demihumans to help you.

20:01.830 --> 20:04.760
But only temporarily.

20:12.780 --> 20:15.470
Oh, it looks like I was right.

20:16.230 --> 20:18.320
Who are you?

20:18.320 --> 20:20.930
I'm Mio. Who are you?

20:21.300 --> 20:24.410
A soldier who directly serves 
His Majesty the Demon King.

20:24.410 --> 20:26.200
Do you want to know more?

20:26.200 --> 20:28.690
Yes. Unless I know your name,

20:29.240 --> 20:32.230
I won't be able to report who I killed.

20:32.620 --> 20:34.400
My name is Left.

20:34.400 --> 20:37.590
Left the mutant mildie dragon.

20:37.590 --> 20:41.760
The dragons have suddenly mutated? 
I thought you were a snake.

20:41.760 --> 20:43.320
Mio, was it?

20:43.320 --> 20:47.820
You seem to have invaded this land. 
Who are you people?

20:49.140 --> 20:51.980
We are the people of Kaleneon.

20:52.890 --> 20:54.970
You claim to be soldiers of a dead nation?

20:54.970 --> 21:00.850
No, Kaleneon has not been destroyed. 
It's been here the whole time.

21:00.850 --> 21:06.500
Nonsense. The demons control 
the land north of Fort Stella.

21:06.830 --> 21:09.330
That's what makes it so convenient.

21:09.330 --> 21:15.130
The hyumans can't object to our 
actions here, in this unknown land.

21:15.130 --> 21:16.590
What?

21:16.590 --> 21:20.800
Truth be told, I don't 
understand it too well myself.

21:21.070 --> 21:25.070
But I will slay you and offer 
this land to my master.

21:25.070 --> 21:27.600
That's all that matters.

21:27.600 --> 21:31.770
Sounds like I'll have to ask 
a lot of questions later.

21:31.770 --> 21:37.310
I wasn't expecting a fight like 
this before we faced the heroes.

21:42.810 --> 21:46.320
I see flames of war. Is that Limia's...

21:46.320 --> 21:47.530
Ur, their royal capital.

21:48.120 --> 21:51.980
A similar battle is probably 
taking place in Gritonia.

21:51.980 --> 21:53.680
I know.

21:54.300 --> 21:56.540
<i>The day has finally come to meet them.</i>

21:57.370 --> 21:58.720
<i>The pair of heroes</i>

21:58.720 --> 22:00.350
<i>also from another world</i>

22:00.350 --> 22:02.470
<i>are here in this place.</i>

23:35.310 --> 23:38.700
Night Twenty-One: 
"The Heroes Fight Bravely."

23:35.510 --> 23:40.310
<b>Next Time</b>

23:37.100 --> 23:40.310
<b>The Heroes Fight Bravely</b>
